   "scope": "global",
   "field": "clusters.commuter",
   "render": "text",
   "title": "Finding commuter corridors",
   "body": "Trips have no stated purpose, so k-means clustering split {summary.kmeans_pairs} busy station pairs on peak share, weekday:weekend ratio and morning/evening direction reversal. {n} pairs landed in the <b>commuter</b> cluster. Click, lasso or drag the sliders to pick pairs and see their routes."
  },
