   "file": "regression.json",
   "scope": "global",
   "field": "headline",
   "render": "text",
   "title": "Does cycle infrastructure attract bike-share trips?",
   "body": "A negative-binomial gravity model of trips between every station pair ({n_pairs} pairs). On commuter corridors, a fully segregated route predicts {irr_full}x the trips (95% CI {irr_lo} to {irr_hi}); at the median 10% exposure that is {irr_median}x. Off commuter corridors the effect is small and uncertain."
  },
